# Template for local environment variables. Copy to .env.local and fill in
# real values there — .env.local is gitignored, this file is committed.
#
# Never put a Supabase service-role key, database password, personal access
# token, JWT secret, or SMTP credential in either file. Only the project URL
# and the PUBLISHABLE anon key belong here — see ACCOUNT-SYSTEM-PLAN.md for
# what each Supabase resource is for once Phase 2 migration begins.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional — only for `npm run test:admin-portal:live`, the opt-in end-to-end
# test of the Super Admin portal against a real project. Names only; put real
# values in .env.local or your shell, never here. Use a throwaway Super Admin.
# SUPABASE_TEST_URL=
# SUPABASE_TEST_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_TEST_SUPERADMIN_EMAIL=
# SUPABASE_TEST_SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD=
